{"id":"4aed37dba54730e2","group":"88","path":"88/88-thm-rice-proof.md","title":"Rice Theorem Proof Form","display":"thm-rice-proof — Rice Theorem Proof Form","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-thm-rice-proof","aliases":["88-thm-rice-proof"],"display":"thm-rice-proof — Rice Theorem Proof Form","depends_on":["[[88-df-rice-property]]","[[88-df-rice-theorem]]","[[88-df-index-set]]","[[88-df-halting-set]]","[[88-df-many-one-reducible]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-partial-computable]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-acceptable-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-smn-theorem]]","[[88-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-thm-rice-proof"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-thm-rice-proof</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice-proof — Rice Theorem Proof Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"596739a9c86dafde\" href=\"?note=596739a9c86dafde\" title=\"88-df-rice-theorem\">88-df-rice-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"47093b2d6b616f97\" href=\"?note=47093b2d6b616f97\" title=\"88-df-halting-set\">88-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\varphi\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\varphi\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的共同编号环境；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\">\\(\\mathrm{AcceptNum}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"eb17d82fac64b1a6\" href=\"?note=eb17d82fac64b1a6\" title=\"88-df-acceptable-program-numbering\">88-df-acceptable-program-numbering</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\">\\(P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"b020503ba5d16dce\" href=\"?note=b020503ba5d16dce\" title=\"88-df-partial-computable\">88-df-partial-computable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"8085e5127aec7739\" href=\"?note=8085e5127aec7739\" title=\"88-df-rice-property\">88-df-rice-property</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"97c2d6a4b728542c\" href=\"?note=97c2d6a4b728542c\" title=\"88-df-index-set\">88-df-index-set</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"596739a9c86dafde\" href=\"?note=596739a9c86dafde\" title=\"88-df-rice-theorem\">88-df-rice-theorem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\">\\(K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"47093b2d6b616f97\" href=\"?note=47093b2d6b616f97\" title=\"88-df-halting-set\">88-df-halting-set</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_m\">\\(\\leq_m\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"87fbc479272c5469\" href=\"?note=87fbc479272c5469\" title=\"88-df-many-one-reducible\">88-df-many-one-reducible</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{SMN}_{1,1}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"1eb79833a139e232\" href=\"?note=1eb79833a139e232\" title=\"88-df-smn-theorem\">88-df-smn-theorem</a>，所需总参数函数由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"2e54d7c09866228f\" href=\"?note=2e54d7c09866228f\" title=\"88-thm-smn\">88-thm-smn</a> 提供。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\to\n\\bigl((K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\leq_m I_P\n\\lor K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\leq_m(\\mathbb N\\setminus I_P))\n\\land\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice\\text{-}proof}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AcceptNum}(\\boldsymbol\\varphi)\\to\n\\forall P\\subseteq\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Rice}(P)\\to\n\\bigl((K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\leq_m I_P\n\\lor K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\leq_m(\\mathbb N\\setminus I_P))\n\\land\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 表示空的部分函数图。先设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin P\">\\(\\bot\\notin P\\)</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in P\">\\(h\\in P\\)</span>。构造二元部分函数：在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(e,x)\">\\((e,x)\\)</span> 上先模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e(e)\">\\(\\varphi_e(e)\\)</span>，它收敛后再模拟 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x)\">\\(h(x)\\)</span>。该函数有编号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，存在总可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r(e)\">\\(r(e)\\)</span> 固化其第一参数，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{r(e)}=\n\\begin{cases}\nh,&amp;e\\in K_{\\mathrm{diag}},\\\\\n\\bot,&amp;e\\notin K_{\\mathrm{diag}}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varphi_{r(e)}=\n\\begin{cases}\nh,&amp;e\\in K_{\\mathrm{diag}},\\\\\n\\bot,&amp;e\\notin K_{\\mathrm{diag}}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\leftrightarrow r(e)\\in I_P\">\\(e\\in K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\leftrightarrow r(e)\\in I_P\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in P\">\\(\\bot\\in P\\)</span>，则对非空补函数类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\setminus P\">\\(\\mathrm{PartComp}_1\\setminus P\\)</span> 应用同一构造，得到到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\setminus I_P\">\\(\\mathbb N\\setminus I_P\\)</span> 的归约。</p>\n<p>最后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\">\\(K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\)</span> 不可判定：若其特征函数可计算，构造“恰在输入不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\">\\(K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\)</span> 时收敛”的部分可计算函数，再把该函数的索引代入自身，得到矛盾。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_P\">\\(I_P\\)</span> 可判定，其补集也可判定，并与上面的总可计算归约复合将判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\">\\(K_{\\mathrm{diag}}\\)</span>，矛盾。故得到所定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\">\\(\\mathrm{RiceUndecidable}(P)\\)</span>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-rice-property","status":"resolved","id":"8085e5127aec7739","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-rice-theorem","status":"resolved","id":"596739a9c86dafde","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-rice-theorem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-index-set","status":"resolved","id":"97c2d6a4b728542c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-index-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"47093b2d6b616f97","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · d